{"title":"Career Roadmap · Clinical Research Coordinator","role":"Clinical Research Coordinator","summary":"A Clinical Research Coordinator (CRC) supports the day-to-day execution of clinical research studies at hospitals, research institutions, academic centres, contract research organizations (CROs), pharmaceutical companies and biotechnology organizations.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)","Course":"Clinical Research (B.Sc)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Clinical Research Coordinator (CRC) supports the day-to-day execution of clinical research studies at hospitals, research institutions, academic centres, contract research organizations (CROs), pharmaceutical companies and biotechnology organizations."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between clinical teams, research participants, investigators, sponsors and research operations."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Study coordination"},{"text":"Participant scheduling"},{"text":"Informed-consent workflow support"},{"text":"Study documentation"},{"text":"Visit coordination"},{"text":"Protocol compliance"},{"text":"Investigational product accountability support"},{"text":"Data collection"},{"text":"Electronic data capture"},{"text":"Adverse-event documentation"},{"text":"Regulatory-document maintenance"},{"text":"Monitoring-visit preparation"},{"text":"Communication with sponsors/CROs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A CRC does not independently make medical treatment decisions. Clinical decisions remain with the appropriately qualified Principal Investigator and clinical team."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12 – PCB / Relevant Eligibility","B.Sc Clinical Research / Relevant Allied Health Degree","Clinical Research Internship","Clinical Research Coordinator","Senior Clini